{"id":"a195d25b945b0fa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Payoff Profile","display":"df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile — ZFC Game4 Payoff Profile","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile — ZFC Game4 Payoff Profile","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile — ZFC Game4 Payoff Profile"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\sigma\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\sigma\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\\sigma(i)\\in\\vec S(i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\\sigma(i)\\in\\vec S(i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u(i),\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(N\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S)):\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\},R\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u(i),\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(N\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S)):\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\},R\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A strategy profile is a set-coded choice function; every player's payoff is a function on the same profile space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R,\\sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,N,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\\sigma(i)\\in\\vec S(i)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}payoff\\text{-}profile} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S(N,\\vec S,\\vec u,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec u,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\\land\n\\forall i\\in N\\;\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\vec u(i),\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(N\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S)):\n\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S(\\sigma,N,\\vec S)\\},R\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ba5a4b6a64820f3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GameProfile}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcGame4PayoffProfile}_S$ are defined in [[./58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile.md|58-df-zfc-game4-payoff-profile]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}